flow for serial board startup:
NOTE: first two steps are only needed on board bring up
NOTE2: easy way to turn off data/ADCs is to run the reconfigure script


didaq_i2c.py -> sets up sampling clocks
reconfigure.py -> reconfigure FPGA, necessary step for sampling clocks to register, ctrl-c this after running 
didaq_adc_config.py -> setup  ADCs and JESD data links
